\pard\keepn\sb240\sa150\f0\fs29\b\cf1 1 \u8212? Technology should help the patient\b0\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Open:} \u8220?This is not a catalogue of impressive tools.\u8221?\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Question:} Does it improve care in the real workflow?\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Cover each time: exact task \u8594? evidence \u8594? our practice \u8594? barriers.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Distinguish {\b current / emerging / research horizon}.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Optional show of hands: scribe, evidence assistant, other AI tool?\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Key line:} A polished output is not a patient outcome.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Transition:} Meet the person before the technology.\par
\pard\keepn\sb240\sa150\f0\fs29\b\cf1 2 \u8212? Meet Michael\b0\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Fictional, 64, self-employed school-bus driver, outside town, patchy internet.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Books for frequency + nocturia; known BPH creates anchoring risk.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Wider story: thirst, fatigue, poor sleep, route safety.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Wants concise written plan + teach-back + fewer trips.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Can refuse technology; phone/paper/ordinary care remain available.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Ordinary assessment later identifies type 2 diabetes\u8212?{\b no AI diagnoses him}.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Ask silently throughout: benefit to Michael, or work/risk shifted to him?\par
\pard\keepn\sb240\sa150\f0\fs29\b\cf1 3 \u8212? Adaptive pre-consultation history\b0\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Task/how:} patient completes adaptive questionnaire; GP receives patient-entered structured summary.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Patient:} private, self-paced way to remember and express concerns.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Doctor:} sees broader agenda early; must still re-take and verify important history.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Evidence:} current platform; independent patient-outcome benefit not established. Trial protocol \u8800? effectiveness result.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Our practice:} target complex/new/chronic-review appointments; decide who checks responses and urgency.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Pitfalls:} non-completion, literacy, language, disability, data cost, internet, summary loses nuance.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Must keep:} phone, paper and ordinary consultation.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Key line:} Widen the doorway; do not make the form the price of entry.\par
\pard\keepn\sb240\sa150\f0\fs29\b\cf1 4 \u8212? Ambient scribe\b0\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Task/how:} consent \u8594? audio \u8594? speech recognition \u8594? language-model summary \u8594? draft \u8594? GP review/correction \u8594? authorised record.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Patient:} possible better eye contact; may disclose less if uncomfortable with recording.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Doctor:} potentially less typing; still checks every clinically important element.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Evidence:} promising workflow/wellbeing signals; manual editing common; safety and Australian patient-outcome evidence limited. Effects vary by tool.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Our practice:} small opt-in pilot; standard consent; audit omissions, fabricated examination, medicine/allergy errors and correction time; ask patients.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Pitfalls:} mishearing, omission, fabrication, chronology, attribution, boilerplate, downstream copy-forward.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Governance:} data location/retention/training; local policy; jurisdiction-specific recording law; MDO/legal advice.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Check Michael:} thirst, fatigue, sleep, route safety; no invented examination.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Key line:} Draft, not record. Clinician remains the author.\par
\pard\keepn\sb240\sa150\f0\fs29\b\cf1 5 \u8212? Evidence-linked prompts\b0\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Task/how:} structured record data + transparent rule/risk logic \u8594? point-of-care prompt or worklist.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Patient:} may not touch system; missing monitoring/prevention becomes visible.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Doctor/team:} checks source data and whether prompt applies; owns action.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Evidence:} Australian feasibility and implementation evidence; outcome depends on rule + data + workflow.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Our practice:} choose one high-value care gap; trace identify \u8594? verify \u8594? contact \u8594? act \u8594? close.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Pitfalls:} incomplete coding, missing external results, stale data, false positives/negatives, alert fatigue.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Key line:} A useful care gap is accurate, actionable and owned.\par
\pard\keepn\sb240\sa150\f0\fs29\b\cf1 6 \u8212? Emerging generative second check\b0\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Task/how:} model analyses entered encounter data; gives constrained diagnostic/treatment feedback inside workflow.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Safe sequence:} independent assessment \u8594? AI feedback \u8594? verify \u8594? clinician decides.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Patient:} indirect safety-net benefit; not diagnosed by chatbot.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Evidence:} AI Consult Kenyan trial, 9,691 patients; no significant improvement in primary 14-day treatment-failure outcome; documentation quality improved. Different setting. GPT-4 access vignette trial did not improve clinician reasoning.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Our practice:} watch/evaluate, not public-chatbot adoption. Demand intended purpose, ARTG status if applicable, local evidence, integration, audit and escalation.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Pitfalls:} persuasive wrong answer, silence mistaken for safety, bad inputs, automation bias, poor population transfer.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Key line:} A capable model is not a safe clinical system.\par
\pard\keepn\sb240\sa150\f0\fs29\b\cf1 7 \u8212? Evidence retrieval\b0\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Task/how:} search curated corpus \u8594? retrieve passages \u8594? generate synthesis + source links.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Patient:} better shared-decision conversation, not a pasted answer.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Doctor:} frame \u8220?works\u8221? \u8594? open citation \u8594? check population/comparator/outcomes/follow-up \u8594? discuss priorities.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Evidence:} MedLuma current Australian example; independent product accuracy/utility/outcome evidence not identified.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Our practice:} compare a non-identifiable question with normal search; assess key-source retrieval and accurate representation.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Pitfalls:} missing source, partial citation support, outdated corpus, flattened disagreement, citation theatre.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Do not:} enter identifiable data or give an unresearched PAE number.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Key line:} Use it to find evidence; its answer is not the evidence.\par
\pard\keepn\sb240\sa150\f0\fs29\b\cf1 8 \u8212? Patient-information drafting\b0\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Task/how:} authoritative sources + defined audience/action \u8594? draft \u8594? claim check \u8594? accessibility/consumer review \u8594? clinician approval \u8594? teach-back.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Patient:} concise plan in preferred format; still checks understanding with GP.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Doctor:} faster first draft and alternate wording; owns every claim.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Evidence:} readability/satisfaction promising; accuracy, completeness and actionability mixed; mostly English research.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Our practice:} choose one common low-risk handout; controlled sources, safety-netting, version control and update owner.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Pitfalls:} lost qualifier, invented fact, ambiguous action, outdated link, update burden, patronising \u8220?simplification\u8221?.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Language:} professional interpreter for complex communication/consent; AI translation is not a substitute.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Key line:} Controlled editorial workflow, not automatic publication.\par
\pard\keepn\sb240\sa150\f0\fs29\b\cf1 9 \u8212? Follow-up, reminders and recalls\b0\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Task/how now:} eligibility rules + structured record \u8594? worklist \u8594? human verification/contact/action/closure.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Future:} tailored two-way messages, simple questions, booking and exception escalation.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Patient:} chooses channel; can correct data or decline optional care.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Team:} distinguish prompt vs reminder vs clinically important recall.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Evidence:} identification/reminders current; safe semi-autonomous closed-loop outreach less mature.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Our practice:} audit one pathway end-to-end; name owner, timeframe, exception and fail-safe.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Pitfalls:} wrong person, wrong eligibility, coercive repetition, digital exclusion, reply nobody reads, hidden reception/nursing workload.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Key line:} Finding the patient is not closure.\par
\pard\keepn\sb240\sa150\f0\fs29\b\cf1 10 \u8212? Remote monitoring\b0\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Task/how:} patient enters device/symptom data \u8594? service receives it \u8594? thresholds or emerging models prioritise change \u8594? team responds.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Patient:} less travel; must know exactly when monitoring occurs and what to do when unwell/disconnected.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Doctor/team:} defined inclusion, review frequency, triggers, after-hours plan, documentation and end date.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Evidence:} Australian monitoring services exist; reliable AI prediction and autonomous response remain emerging.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Our practice:} only for a defined problem with funded response capacity; begin time-limited.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Pitfalls:} false alarms, missing data, anxiety, device/connectivity inequity, unclear ownership, false belief of continuous watching.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Key line:} Design responsibility before collecting data.\par
\pard\keepn\sb240\sa150\f0\fs29\b\cf1 11 \u8212? Individual treatment optimisation\b0\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Task/how:} estimate difference in benefit/harm between reasonable treatments for one person; show uncertainty.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Patient + GP:} use output inside shared decision-making; no autonomous prescription.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Evidence:} PERSONAL antiseizure-medicine trial makes direction credible; does not establish general GP or diabetes system.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Our practice:} no adoption proposal; learn what evidence to demand.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Ask: treatment effect or prognosis? External validation? Calibration? Representative population? Real workflow outcome?\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Pitfalls:} false precision, biased data, poor transfer, obsolete model, patient preference reduced to a variable.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Key line:} Personalised prediction should strengthen\u8212?not replace\u8212?preference.\par
\pard\keepn\sb240\sa150\f0\fs29\b\cf1 12 \u8212? Narrow retinal image AI\b0\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Task/how:} retinal image \u8594? task-specific classifier \u8594? image-quality/result pathway \u8594? confirmation/referral.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Patient:} screening closer to practice; ungradable \u8800? negative.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Doctor/team:} acquisition, quality, communication, confirmatory assessment and referral.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Evidence:} Australian GP glaucoma study: 414 recruited, 277 analysable; sensitivity 65.0%, specificity 94.6%; acquisition was a major limitation. Do not transfer figures to diabetic-retinopathy screening.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Our practice:} first map exact condition, device/intended purpose, regulation, equipment/training, reimbursement and referral capacity.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Pitfalls:} ungradable images, false reassurance, cost, operator skill, group performance, referral bottleneck.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Key line:} The pathway\u8212?not only the classifier\u8212?determines benefit.\par
\pard\keepn\sb240\sa150\f0\fs29\b\cf1 13 \u8212? Clinician-learning appendix (optional)\b0\par
\pard\keepn\sb190\sa90\f0\fs24\b\cf4 Diagnostic brainstorming\b0\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Fictional/de-identified case only.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Independent reasoning \u8594? synthetic challenge \u8594? authoritative verification.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Benefit: cognitive forcing; possible omitted diagnosis.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Evidence: public LLM access has not shown improved physician reasoning in cited trial.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Pitfalls: anchoring, rare-disease noise, invented facts, extra tests, privacy breach.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Practice use: education session, not undocumented patient-specific second opinion.\par
\pard\keepn\sb190\sa90\f0\fs24\b\cf4 AI-assisted Anki\b0\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Selected source \u8594? draft one-point cards \u8594? check facts/qualifiers/source \u8594? Anki schedules review.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Evidence supports feasibility, not better competence or patient outcomes.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Practice use: small, reviewed deck from an agreed guideline update.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Pitfalls: plausible clutter, repeated misinformation, future maintenance.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Key line:} Challenge and draft; do not outsource understanding.\par
\pard\keepn\sb240\sa150\f0\fs29\b\cf1 14 \u8212? Close\b0\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b System may:} capture, retrieve, classify, prioritise, draft, monitor.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Patient + clinician still:} choose, interpret, verify, decide, respond, remain accountable.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Three possible practice conversations:\par
\pard\sa115\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs22\cf1   - Standardise consent + error audit for any scribe trial.\par
\pard\sa115\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs22\cf1   - Choose one care-gap/recall pathway and give it ownership through closure.\par
\pard\sa115\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs22\cf1   - Trial one source-grounded, reviewed patient-information workflow.\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab Six closing questions: exact task? maturity? workflow evidence? data? refusal? failure/fallback?\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Final line:} \u8220?Define the task. Appraise the workflow. Protect choice and data. Keep a fallback. Own the consequence.\u8221?\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab {\b Invite discussion:} Most useful here? What hidden workload or risk must be solved first?\par
\pard\keepn\sb240\sa150\f0\fs29\b\cf1 If challenged on the evidence\b0\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab \u8220?The review was targeted, not systematic.\u8221?\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab \u8220?Most claims are task-, product-, version- and workflow-specific.\u8221?\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab \u8220?Vendor material describes function, not benefit.\u8221?\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab \u8220?Australian evidence remains limited for several categories.\u8221?\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab \u8220?A benchmark result or ARTG inclusion does not prove local clinical utility.\u8221?\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab \u8220?The responsible next step is a defined pilot with measures and stop criteria\u8212?not broad adoption.\u8221?\par
