\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab \u8220?No AI makes Michael\u8217?s diagnosis.\u8221?\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab \u8220?A scribe creates a draft, not a record.\u8221?\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab \u8220?Citations help us check an answer; they do not make it correct.\u8221?\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab \u8220?Remote monitoring does not mean continuous watching.\u8221?\par
\pard\li720\fi-300\tx720\sa65\f0\fs21\cf1\bullet\tab \u8220?An ungradable image is not a negative screen.\u8221?\par
